OL,3,GNEWSAD-Day veteran to receive medals 82
OL,4,Ayears on
OL,5,
OL,6,FLuke Halley, Douglas's grandson, said:
OL,7,F"I feel absolutely honoured that after
OL,8,Fall these years he will get them."
